  "recipe": {
    "technique": "Binding the restrained partner to an outside object, such as a Saint Andrew's cross, a chair, or a table. Hindering or slowing down the movement of the restrained partner, such as with a hobble skirt or a corset. Wrapping the restrained partner up in soft, elastic material, thus restraining their entire body. This is known as mummification. Many people feel that bondage must be \"rough and tough\", as seen in many images of bondage erotica, but this is not always true."
  },
